47
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:21,000
On pre-start, for the initialization of the measurement.

48
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:24,000
On start, when the measurement starts.

49
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:30,000
On stop of measurement, if we have to do something when the measurement ends.

50
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:40,000
On error active, passive, or pass off, that reacts for specific diagnostic condition.

51
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:43,000
On timer, if a timer elapses.

52
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:47,000
